* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* RMPRNAT - Print Object via PRINNatural Report Number (11) (text)
*           or via work file 3 (binary).
*
* Maintenance
* uuu     yyyy-mm-dd s(999999) Action
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* fhi     2005-08-10 initial   Created from template RMPRTCP
* LP      2005-10-26 force open printer
* fhi     2005-12-09 FHI208    Allow generic printer name using '&'
* fhi     2005-12-09 FHI211    Reset printer definition at close
* fhi     2006-05-22 P279826   Make better time resolution of FHI208
* fhi     2007-04-26 FHI225    Linesizes not honoured, only LS=80 done.
* xsetggr 2007-05-02 NOM3201   Support 5 byte node numbers
* fhi     2007-07-12 NOM3202   C-NATERR changed, NAD23006 is obsolete.
* fhi     2007-07-17 NRT2422   print binary documents
* xsetggr 2007-11-05 NRT2768   show size of binary documnets in bytes
* xsetggr 2008-01-15 p(300297) record length in format N5
* fhi     2008-02-18 NRT2782   Follow printer status
* fhi     2008-04-18 P304107   Separator page creates extra file.
* fhi     2008-04-24 P303640   Set -l switch for lp/lpr usage if binary
* fhi     2008-04-24 P304523   Correct 303640
* xsetggr 2008-06-10 p(292935) fill po-printed only after successfull
*                              end of printing
* fhi     2008-06-20 P304523   Binary reports printed in error
* fhi     2008-06-20 P303640   Binary data corrupted
* xsetggr 2008-07-03 P304350   restow due to changes in rmspl--l
* fhi     2008-08-22 P307993   lpstat does not work correctly
* fhi     2008-08-22 P308134   wait-printer needs user message
* xsetggr 2008-11-26 P311559 restow due to unix attr changes in rmspl--l
* bli     2009-01-21 p307959 restow due to unix attr changes in rmspl--l
* fhi     2009-05-19 N3463     Extend metadata for OPO
* fhi     2009-07-13 P315057   Wrong printer status returned.
* fhi     2009-09-07 P319282   Statement misspelled.
* fhi     2009-11-11 P321483   New Status 'X' wait for external ok      ONTENTS
* fhi     2010-04-07 P325081   Change priority for build of file-id     ONTENTS
* xsetggr 2010-04-09 P307403   open-close processing does not work for
*                              binary files
* fhi     2010-04-12 P307403   &f replacement does not work, make &t    ONTENTS
* fhi     2010-06-28 NOMALL-823 Allow &-symbols also for Output-Target 1 ONTENTS
* fhi     2010-08-16 NOMALL-823 Add trace for & replacement              ONTENTS
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* fhi     2010-09-21 NOMALL-97 Use no more C-NATERR but C-NATERN instead
* fhi     2010-09-30 NOMALL-853 introduce trace for XXUX---N, no tags.
* fhi     2010-11-12 NOMALL-856 Extend symbol handling
* fhi     2010-11-17 NOMALL-856 Use new symbol replacement
* fhi     2010-12-20 NOMALL-97 Save File Handle for NPR Unix
* xsetggr 2010-12-21 NOMALL-865 restow due to changes in RMFL---P
* fhi     2010-03-04 NOMALL-856 Spool Attributes were blank
* fhi     2011-04-26 NOMALL-966 Do not suppress last line with Pr-Exit
* fhi     2012-04-03 NOMALL-1119 Recataloged due to changes of XXUX---P
* fhi     2012-06-01 NOMALL-1148 Formfeed missing between copies
* fhi     2012-06-05 NOMALL-1148 Further corrections, mainframe deleted.
*                                No tags for that.
* fhi     2012-06-25 NOMALL-1148 Further corrections, added trace output
*                                Partly rewritten without tags.
* fhi     2012-06-26 NOMALL-1148 Further corrections
* fhi     2012-07-30 NOMALL-1148 Further corrections
* fhi     2012-07-31 NOMALL-1148 Partly rewritten, tags deleted
* fhi     2012-11-14 NOMALL-1143 Add occurrence for Base64
* SU1     2013-01-31 unused      Deactivate unused data areas
* fhi     2014-08-29 NOMALL-1454 Recataloged due to changes of XXUX---P
* fhi     2014-10-21 NOMALL-79   Introduce long filenames
* SU2     2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* SU3     2015-02-27 NOMALL-1569 USR1052N (SYSEXT) => NAT00078(SYSLIBS)+
*                                USR1069N (SYSEXT) => NAT00080(SYSLIBS)
* fhi     2015-05-18 NOMALL-1552 Show real size, not base64 size
* SU4     2015-06-01 NOMALL-1552 Show size 1 (instead 0)
* fhi     2015-06-22 NOMALL-1573 Correct bracket handling
* fhi     2015-06-25 NOMALL-1573 Correct special char !
* fhi     2015-06-29 NOMALL-1573 Change behavior for binary reports,
*                                do not use work files any more
* fhi     2015-07-02 NOMALL-1573 Adapt CC handling
* fhi     2015-07-23 NOMALL-1573 same
* SU5     2015-08-11 NOMALL-1690 XXHASH restructure
* SU6     2015-12-30 NOMALL-1722 XXHASH-P changed->recat
* SU7     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* SU8     2016-03-08 NOMALL-1847 PDA RMPRAPIP -> PDA P-PEXIT
* SU9     2017-02-28 NOMALL-1980 avoid NAT1257:non-materialized X-array
* SU10    2017-04-11 NOMALL-1980 use WORK FILE for binary rep./backout
*                                "fhi 2015-06-29 NOMALL-1573"
* fhi     2018-03-21 NOMALL-1918 Avoid AIV in PERFORM ext. subroutine
* bli     2018-07-19 NOMALL-2088 error handling
* BLI     2019-05-06 NOMALL-2261 Recataloged due to changes of XXUX---P
* SU11    2024-07-25 NOM 353     Recataloged due to changes of RMPR-C
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER USING RMFL---P
PARAMETER
1 LINE-PARMS
  2 LINE-CURRENT              (P3)
  2 LINE-TAB                  (1:100)
    3 LINE                    (A251)
    3 REDEFINE    LINE
      4 LINE-L                (A1/1:251)
    3 LINE-NUMBER             (P10)
PARAMETER USING XXUX---P
PARAMETER
1 P-ERROR-CODE                (N4)
1 P-ERROR-TEXT                (A250)
************************************************************************
INDEPENDENT
1 +PRINTER_OPEN               (L)
1 +TEMPFILE                   (A50)
1 +PHYSICAL-NAME              (A80)
1 +TOP-OF-PAGE                (L)
1 +INSERT-FORMFEED            (L)
************************************************************************
LOCAL USING P-PEXIT
LOCAL USING RCCTYP-E
LOCAL USING RMASAC-E
LOCAL USING RMMCASAP
LOCAL USING RMBAS64P   /* parameter for BASE64 conversion
LOCAL USING VUXDEF-L
LOCAL USING XXGMSG-A
LOCAL USING RMSPL--L
LOCAL USING RMSR---E
LOCAL USING XXHASH-P
*
LOCAL
1 ORDER-STATUS VIEW OF NRM-PRINTOUTS
  2 PO-STATUS
  2 PO-USERID
  2 PO-MSG
  2 PO-LAST-PRINTED-RECNO
  2 PO-JOBCARD                (1:3)
  2 PO-REPNAME
  2 PO-REPRNB
1 ACTIVE-REPORTS VIEW OF NRM-ACTIVE-REPORTS
  2 AR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES
* *****
1 NAT00080L
  2 FUNCTION                  (A1)
  2 PRINTER-ID                (I1) INIT <11>
  2 PHYSICAL-NAME             (A80)
  2 PAGE-SIZE                 (I4)
  2 LINE-SIZE                 (I4) INIT <80>
  2 MAX-PAGES                 (I4)
  2 PRINT-METHOD              (A8) INIT <'TTY'>
  2 LOGICAL-NAME              (A8) INIT <'LPT11'>
  2 RESPONSE                  (I4)
1 NAT00080N
  2 VERSION                   (I1) INIT <1>
  2 OUTPUT-TARGET             (I4)
1 REDEFINE NAT00080N
  2 EXTENDED-PARMS
    3 EXTENDED-DATA           (A1/1:5)
1 I                           (P3)
1 #STATUS                     (A1)
1 #MSG                        (A60)
1 #UPD-COUNTER                (N8) INIT <10>
1 #SAVE-LINE                  (A251)
1 #OLD-RECORD-LENGTH          (P5)
1 LAST-BUFFER                 (L)
1 FIRST-BUFFER                (L)
1 FIRST-SEGMENT-BUFFER        (L)
1 LAST-SEGMENT-BUFFER         (L)
1 #FLUSH-LINE                 (A251)
1 REDEFINE #FLUSH-LINE
  2 #FLUSH-CC                 (A1)
  2 #FLUSH-TEXT               (A250)
1 #IND                        (I4)
1 #PO-USERID                  (A8)
1 #BYTES                      (P11)
1 #PRINTER                    (A80)
1 #PHYSICAL-NAME              (A80)
1 #TEN-SECONDS                (I2) INIT <10>
1 #OS-COMMAND                 (A253)
1 #OS-RESPONSE                (I4)
1 #BIN                        (A) DYNAMIC
1 #LEN                        (I4)
1 #REPORT-RNB                 (A31)
1 REDEFINE #REPORT-RNB
  2 #REPNAME                  (A25)
  2 #REPRNB                   (P11)
1 #FILE-ID                    (A120)
1 #RECORD                     (A250)
1 #RETRY                      (P3)
1 #RETRIES                    (P3) CONST <6>
1 #RETRY-INTERVAL             (I2) CONST <5>
1 #I                          (P3)
1 #PO-JOBCARD                 (A72)
1 #NPR-TRACE-INT              (I2)
1 #ERC                        (N4)
1 #ERT                        (A250)
1 #BIN-ALLOWED                (L) CONST <TRUE>
1 #BS2-ALLOWED                (L) CONST <FALSE>
1 #TRACING                    (L) CONST <FALSE>
1 #TRACE-MSG                  (A250)
1 #TEMPFILE                   (A50)
*
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
FORMAT (0) PS=0 LS=250
*
* Prepare environment
*
ADD 1 TO FLUSH-BUFFERS
ADD 1 TO FLUSH-COUNTER
EXAMINE NATUNIX-PROFILE TRANSLATE INTO UPPER CASE
* Handle form feed parameter:
EXAMINE NATUNIX-FORMFEED TRANSLATE INTO UPPER CASE
DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF  NATUNIX-FORMFEED
  VALUE ' '
    NATUNIX-FORMFEED := 'BEFORE' /* take Natural's leading form feed
  VALUES 'AFTER','BEFORE','NONE','BOTH'
    IGNORE
  NONE
    NATUNIX-FORMFEED := 'BEFORE' /* take Natural's leading form feed
END-DECIDE
*
* Check and set the bracket variables
*
DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION
  WHEN FLUSH-SEG-BRACKET = 'L' OR = 'A'
    LAST-SEGMENT-BUFFER := TRUE
  WHEN FLUSH-SEG-BRACKET = 'F' OR = 'A'
    FIRST-SEGMENT-BUFFER := TRUE
  WHEN FLUSH-SEGMENT = 'L' OR = 'A'
      AND FLUSH-SEG-BRACKET = 'L' OR = 'A'
      AND FLUSH-BRACKET = 'L'
    LAST-BUFFER := TRUE
  WHEN FLUSH-SEGMENT = 'F' OR = 'A'
      AND FLUSH-SEG-BRACKET = 'F' OR = 'A'
    FIRST-BUFFER := TRUE
  WHEN NONE
    IGNORE
END-DECIDE
IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
  PRINT *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    'Bracketing:' '=' FLUSH-BRACKET '=' FLUSH-SEGMENT
    '=' FLUSH-SEG-BRACKET / 23T '=' FIRST-BUFFER '=' LAST-BUFFER
    '=' FIRST-SEGMENT-BUFFER '=' LAST-SEGMENT-BUFFER
END-IF
IF FIRST-BUFFER
  PERFORM PRINTER-OPEN
  IF P-ERROR-CODE NE 0
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
  END-IF
  #OLD-RECORD-LENGTH := FLUSH-RECORD-LENGTH
END-IF
*
* Print the received block of lines
*
FOR I = 1 TO LINE-CURRENT
  PERFORM CALL-PRINTER-EXIT
  IF P-ERROR-CODE NE 0
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
  END-IF
END-FOR
IF LAST-BUFFER
  PERFORM PRINTER-CLOSE
  PERFORM WAIT-FOR-PRINTER
END-IF
*
************************************************************************
* End of main line (now subroutines):
************************************************************************
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE UPDATE-STATUS
************************************************************************
IF FLUSH-POID = 0
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
FNDOS. FIND ORDER-STATUS WITH PO-ID = FLUSH-POID
  PO-STATUS := #STATUS
  FOR-JOBC. FOR #I = 1 TO 3
    #PO-JOBCARD := PO-JOBCARD (#I)
    EXAMINE #PO-JOBCARD TRANSLATE INTO UPPER
    IF #PO-JOBCARD = SCAN ('EXTERNAL-OK')  /* confirm manually
      PO-STATUS := 'X'
      ESCAPE BOTTOM (FOR-JOBC.)
    END-IF
  END-FOR
  PO-MSG := #MSG
  IF FLUSH-CC-TYPE = BINARY
    PO-LAST-PRINTED-RECNO := (FLUSH-LINES / 1024) * 3 / 4 + 1
  ELSE
    PO-LAST-PRINTED-RECNO := FLUSH-LINES
  END-IF
  #PO-USERID     := PO-USERID
  UPDATE (FNDOS.)
  END OF TRANSACTION
END-FIND
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* UPDATE-STATUS
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE PRINTER-OPEN
************************************************************************
IF +PRINTER_OPEN
  IF NOT +TOP-OF-PAGE
    +INSERT-FORMFEED := TRUE
  ELSE
    RESET +INSERT-FORMFEED
  END-IF
  ESCAPE ROUTINE /* leave it open, no open processing
END-IF
RESET +PRINTER_OPEN
IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
  #NPR-TRACE-INT := *LEVEL + 1
  WRITE (AL=16) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    'Opening printer' 'profile' NATUNIX-PROFILE /
    'Using POID' FLUSH-POID 'with copies' FLUSH-COPIES 'where' /
    'Report =' FLUSH-REPNAME /
    'Bundle =' FLUSH-BUNDLE /
END-IF
PHYSICAL-NAME := NATUNIX-PHYSICAL-NAME
IF FLUSH-CC-TYPE = BINARY AND
    PHYSICAL-NAME = SCAN ('lp ') OR = SCAN ('lpr ')
  IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
    WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
      'Adding -l switch to lp/lpr command'
  END-IF
  EXAMINE PHYSICAL-NAME FOR FULL 'lp '  REPLACE FIRST WITH FULL 'lp -l '   /* binary pri
  EXAMINE PHYSICAL-NAME FOR FULL 'lpr ' REPLACE FIRST WITH FULL 'lpr -l '
END-IF
PERFORM GET-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES /* and update PHYSICAL-NAME
#PHYSICAL-NAME := PHYSICAL-NAME                /* NOMALL-823 in
PERFORM RMFL---S-SUBSTITUTE-SYMBOLS FLUSH-PARMS PHYSICAL-NAME
  #SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES /* NOMALL-856 2011-03-04 in
IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2' AND PHYSICAL-NAME NE #PHYSICAL-NAME
  WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    'Replaced:'        / 32T #PHYSICAL-NAME / 32T PHYSICAL-NAME
END-IF
#TEMPFILE      := '$EOM_WORK/out-&TMST.&RND.'
PERFORM RMFL---S-SUBSTITUTE-SYMBOLS FLUSH-PARMS #TEMPFILE
  #SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES /* NOMALL-856 2011-03-04 in
+TEMPFILE      := #TEMPFILE
PAGE-SIZE      := NATUNIX-PAGE-SIZE
LINE-SIZE      := NATUNIX-LINE-SIZE
MAX-PAGES      := NATUNIX-MAX-PAGES
PRINT-METHOD   := NATUNIX-PRINT-METHOD
OUTPUT-TARGET  := NATUNIX-OUTPUT-TARGET
#PHYSICAL-NAME := PHYSICAL-NAME
PERFORM GET-NODE
PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS
  PHYSICAL-NAME #ERC #ERT XXUX---P
IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2' AND PHYSICAL-NAME NE #PHYSICAL-NAME
  WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    'Resolved:'        / 32T #PHYSICAL-NAME / 32T PHYSICAL-NAME
END-IF
+PHYSICAL-NAME := #PHYSICAL-NAME := PHYSICAL-NAME
IF LINE-SIZE = 0
  LINE-SIZE    := 132
END-IF
IF MAX-PAGES = 0
  MAX-PAGES    := 99999
END-IF
EXAMINE PRINT-METHOD TRANSLATE INTO UPPER CASE
IF PRINT-METHOD = ' '
  PRINT-METHOD := 'TTY'
END-IF
IF OUTPUT-TARGET = 0
  OUTPUT-TARGET := 1
END-IF
IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
  PRINT *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    'Parameters:' '=' PAGE-SIZE '=' LINE-SIZE '=' MAX-PAGES /
    '=' PRINT-METHOD '=' OUTPUT-TARGET / '=' PHYSICAL-NAME //
END-IF
IF FLUSH-CC-TYPE NE BINARY
  FORMAT (11) LS=250 PS=0
  FUNCTION := 'R'
  CALLNAT 'NAT00080' NAT00080L NAT00080N.EXTENDED-PARMS
  FUNCTION := 'S'
  CALLNAT 'NAT00080' NAT00080L NAT00080N.EXTENDED-PARMS
  IF RESPONSE NE 0
    P-ERROR-CODE   := 5
    COMPRESS 'Open Printer failed, subcode:' RESPONSE TO P-ERROR-TEXT
    FLUSH-ERROR := TRUE
    ESCAPE MODULE
  END-IF
  DEFINE PRINTER (11) OUTPUT 'LPT11' PROFILE NATUNIX-PROFILE
ELSE
  IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
    WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
      'Using temporary file' +TEMPFILE
  END-IF
  DEFINE WORK FILE 3 +TEMPFILE TYPE 'UNFORMATTED'
END-IF
+PRINTER_OPEN := TRUE
+TOP-OF-PAGE := TRUE
IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
  WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    'Top of page'
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* PRINTER-OPEN
*                                                                       -
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE PRINT-IT
************************************************************************
*** Handle carriage control for TYPE=AL. (TYPE=AL reports may contain
*** a micture of ASA, Machine, and no carriage control).
*** 1. If first character is a valid ASA carriage control, do nothing
*** 2. If first character is printable (but not X'89' or X'8B' which
***    are machine skip to channel 1), assume the record has no
***    carriage control - shift the record right 1 position and put a
***    space in column 1.
*** 3. Otherwise, first character must be machine carriage control so
***    translate it to ASA.
*
IF FLUSH-TYPE-AL = 'Y'
  #FLUSH-LINE  := LINE(I)
  EXAMINE FULL RMASAC-ASA-CODES(*) FOR #FLUSH-CC GIVING INDEX #IND
  IF #IND = 0                            /* not ASA
    IF #FLUSH-CC = MASK(P) AND #FLUSH-CC NE H'89' AND #FLUSH-CC NE H'8B'
      RESET #FLUSH-CC
      #FLUSH-TEXT:= LINE(I)
      LINE(I):= #FLUSH-LINE
      RESET FLUSH-SAVE-CC
    ELSE
      RMMCASA-PARMS.P-RECORD := LINE (I)
      RMMCASA-PARMS.P-PREV-CC := FLUSH-SAVE-CC
      CALLNAT 'RMMCASAN' RMMCASA-PARMS
      FLUSH-SAVE-CC := RMMCASA-PARMS.P-PREV-CC
      IF RMMCASA-PARMS.P-PRINT-NUMBER > 0
        LINE (I) := RMMCASA-PARMS.P-RECORD
      ELSE
        ESCAPE ROUTINE
      END-IF
    END-IF
  ELSE
    RESET FLUSH-SAVE-CC
  END-IF
ELSE
  DECIDE ON  FIRST VALUE OF FLUSH-CC-TYPE
    VALUE MACHINE-CODE
      PERFORM MACHINE-TO-ASA
    VALUE NO-CC
      PERFORM NO-CC-TO-ASA
    VALUE BINARY
      PERFORM BASE64-TO-BIN
      IF P-ERROR-CODE NE 0
        ESCAPE ROUTINE
      END-IF
    NONE
      IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
END-IF
IF FLUSH-CC-TYPE NE BINARY
  FLUSH-CC-TYPE := ASA-CODE
  DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION /* FORMFEED HANDLING
    WHEN    FIRST-BUFFER AND I = 1
        AND NATUNIX-FORMFEED = 'AFTER' OR = 'NONE'
      MOVE ' ' TO SUBSTR(LINE(I),1,1)
      IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
          'Suppressed ASA formfeed due to parameter'
          NATUNIX-FORMFEED 'for' LINE(I) '...'
      END-IF
    WHEN FIRST-SEGMENT-BUFFER AND I = 1 AND +TOP-OF-PAGE
      MOVE ' ' TO SUBSTR(LINE(I),1,1)
      IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
          'Already on top of page. Suppressed ASA formfeed for'
          LINE(I) '...'
      END-IF
    WHEN   +INSERT-FORMFEED OR (FIRST-BUFFER AND I = 1)
        AND NATUNIX-FORMFEED = 'BEFORE' OR = 'BOTH'
      RESET +INSERT-FORMFEED
      MOVE '1' TO SUBSTR(LINE(I),1,1)
    WHEN   FIRST-SEGMENT-BUFFER AND I = 1
        AND NOT FIRST-BUFFER
      MOVE '1' TO SUBSTR(LINE(I),1,1)
      IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
          'Starting ASA formfeed inserted into' LINE(I) '...'
/* The first formfeed of a whole printout
      END-IF
    WHEN    LAST-BUFFER AND I = LINE-CURRENT
        AND NATUNIX-FORMFEED NE 'BEFORE' AND NATUNIX-FORMFEED NE 'NONE'
        AND NOT +TOP-OF-PAGE
      IF SUBSTR(LINE(I),1,1) = '1'
        MOVE 'Y' TO SUBSTR(LINE(I),1,1) /*form feed before + after line
      ELSE
        MOVE 'X' TO SUBSTR(LINE(I),1,1) /* form feed after line
      END-IF
      IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
          'Added trailing ASA formfeed.'
/* The very last formfeed of a whole printout
      END-IF
    WHEN LAST-SEGMENT-BUFFER AND I = LINE-CURRENT
    AND NOT +TOP-OF-PAGE AND FLUSH-BRACKET NE 'L'                     /*
      +INSERT-FORMFEED := TRUE /* for next line
      IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
          'Separating ASA formfeed inserted.'
/* A formfeed was inserted to separate the output portions
      END-IF
    WHEN NONE
      IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
  PERFORM ASA-TO-NO-CC
  ADD 1 TO FLUSH-LINES
ELSE
  ADD #BYTES TO FLUSH-LINES
END-IF
IF FLUSH-COUNTER > #UPD-COUNTER OR FLUSH-BRACKET = 'L'
  #STATUS := 'P'
  PERFORM UPDATE-STATUS
  RESET FLUSH-COUNTER
END-IF
*
IF FLUSH-CC-TYPE NE BINARY
  IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
    WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
      'Writing line ' LINE(I) (AL=40)
  END-IF
  EXAMINE LINE(I) FOR 'X' GIVING LENGTH #LEN
  IF #LEN > 0
  AND SUBSTR(LINE(I),#LEN,1) NE H'0C' /*last char of line is no formfeed
    RESET +TOP-OF-PAGE
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Top of page reset'
    END-IF
  END-IF
  PRINT (11) NOTITLE NOHDR LINE(I)
ELSE
  RESET #BIN
  REDUCE DYNAMIC #BIN TO 0
  #BIN := SUBSTR (LINE(I),1,#BYTES)
  WRITE WORK FILE 3 VARIABLE #BIN
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* PRINT-IT
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE PRINTER-CLOSE
************************************************************************
IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
  #NPR-TRACE-INT := 0
  PRINT / *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    '--- Closing printer ---' /
END-IF
IF FLUSH-CC-TYPE NE BINARY
  CLOSE PRINTER (11)
  RESET +TOP-OF-PAGE
  IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
    WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
      'Top of page reset'
  END-IF
  FUNCTION := 'R' /* Reset printer definition
  CALLNAT 'NAT00080' NAT00080L NAT00080N.EXTENDED-PARMS
  IF RESPONSE NE 0
    P-ERROR-CODE := 5
    COMPRESS 'Close Printer failed, subcode:' RESPONSE TO P-ERROR-TEXT
    FLUSH-ERROR := TRUE
    ESCAPE MODULE
  END-IF
ELSE
  CLOSE WORK FILE 3
  DECIDE ON EVERY VALUE OF NATUNIX-OUTPUT-TARGET
    VALUE 1                             /* real printer or pipe to program
      COMPRESS 'cat' +TEMPFILE '!' +PHYSICAL-NAME
        'NOSCREENIO' TO #OS-COMMAND
    VALUE 2 /* output to a file
      COMPRESS 'mv' +TEMPFILE +PHYSICAL-NAME 'NOSCREENIO' TO #OS-COMMAND
    VALUES 1,2
      IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
        WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
          'Executing:' #OS-COMMAND (AL=90)
      END-IF
      CALLNAT 'NAT00078' #OS-COMMAND #OS-RESPONSE
      IF #OS-RESPONSE NE 0
        P-ERROR-CODE := 727 /* Output failed, OS response:1:
        COMPRESS NUMERIC #OS-RESPONSE TO P-ERROR-TEXT /*show -1 as -1
        FLUSH-ERROR  := TRUE
        ESCAPE MODULE
      END-IF
    VALUE 1
      COMPRESS 'rm' +TEMPFILE 'NOSCREENIO' TO #OS-COMMAND
      IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
        WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
          'Executing:' #OS-COMMAND (AL=90)
      END-IF
      CALLNAT 'NAT00078' #OS-COMMAND #OS-RESPONSE
    NONE
      P-ERROR-CODE := 4204 /* wrong parameter
      FLUSH-ERROR  := TRUE
      ESCAPE MODULE
  END-DECIDE
  IF #OS-RESPONSE NE 0
    P-ERROR-CODE := 727 /* Output failed, OS response:1:
    P-ERROR-TEXT := #OS-RESPONSE
    FLUSH-ERROR  := TRUE
    ESCAPE MODULE
  END-IF
END-IF
RESET  +PRINTER_OPEN
IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
  WRITE (AL=16) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    'Printer closed' 'profile' NATUNIX-PROFILE /
    'Using POID' FLUSH-POID 'with copies' FLUSH-COPIES 'where' /
    'Report =' FLUSH-REPNAME / 'Bundle =' FLUSH-BUNDLE / /
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* PRINTER-CLOSE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE GET-NODE
************************************************************************
IF P-NODE-NAME NE ' '
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
RESET XXUX---P
READ-LOOP. READ UX-NODES BY UX-NODE-NAME
  REJECT IF NOT(UX-NODES.UX-NODE-SUSPEND ='M' OR='L')
  RESET XXUX---P
  RESET P-PASSWORD
  P-NODE-NAME       := UX-NODES.UX-NODE-NAME
  P-NODE-SUSPEND    := UX-NODES.UX-NODE-SUSPEND
  P-USERID          := UX-NODES.UX-NODE-USERID
  P-CIPHER-PASSWORD := UX-NODES.UX-NODE-PASSWORD
  P-GROUP           := UX-NODES.UX-NODE-GROUP
  ESCAPE BOTTOM (READ-LOOP.)
END-READ
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* GET-NODE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE WAIT-FOR-PRINTER
************************************************************************
IF PO-JOBCARD(*) = SCAN ('WAIT-PRINTER')  /* wait for printer only if
*                                          /* requested in job cards.
    AND NATUNIX-OUTPUT-TARGET = 1          /* only for real printers
    AND (+PHYSICAL-NAME = SCAN('lp ')      /* lpstat is only reasonable if
    OR +PHYSICAL-NAME = SCAN('lpr '))    /* printout has been passed to lpr
  IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
    WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
      'lp or lpr call detected. Preparing WAIT-PRINTER check'
  END-IF
  IGNORE /* and continue.
ELSE
  IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
    WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
      'No WAIT-PRINTER check possible, no lp/lpr found'
  END-IF
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
PERFORM GET-NODE
IF P-NODE-NAME = ' '
  #XX-ERROR-CODE := 2048
  CALLNAT 'XXGMSG-N' #XX-GMSG-PARMS
  P-ERROR-TEXT := #XX-SHORT-TEXT
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
* Check for the real printer name that was used
#PHYSICAL-NAME := +PHYSICAL-NAME
RESET #PRINTER
REPEAT
  UNTIL #PHYSICAL-NAME = ' '
  SEPARATE #PHYSICAL-NAME INTO #PRINTER REMAINDER #PHYSICAL-NAME
    WITH DELIMITERS ' '
  IF SUBSTR(#PRINTER,1,2)='-P' OR='-d' /*printer parameter of lpr cmd
    IF SUBSTR(#PRINTER,3,1) = ' '
      SEPARATE #PHYSICAL-NAME INTO #PRINTER IGNORE WITH DELIMITERS ' '
    ELSE
      #PRINTER := SUBSTR(#PRINTER,3)
    END-IF
    ESCAPE BOTTOM
  END-IF
  RESET #PRINTER
END-REPEAT
* Now check the status of the printer
REPEAT
  XXUX---P.P-FUNCTION := 'COMMAND'
  COMPRESS '$NOMDIR/$NOMVERS/nomchkpr.bsh'
    #PRINTER FLUSH-POID TO XXUX---P.P-RECORD
  COMPRESS '$EOM_WORK/nomchkpr.' *PID TO P-FILE-NAME LEAVING NO
  IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
    WRITE (AL=40)  *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
      'Calling' XXUX---P.P-RECORD /
      32T 'Logfile' P-FILE-NAME
  END-IF
  CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
  IF P-ERC = 0
    PERFORM SET-PRINTING-STATUS
  ELSE
    RESET #XX-ERROR-CODE P-ERROR-CODE
    DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
      WHEN P-ERC = 5       /* NOMALL-2088 handle SAT errors
          AND (P-ERT = SCAN 'SAT1114'
          OR P-ERT = SCAN 'SAT1115')
        #XX-ERROR-CODE := P-ERROR-CODE := 2031 /* node inactive
      WHEN P-ERC > 1999 /* no return code from Unix command but from interface
        #XX-ERROR-CODE := P-ERROR-CODE := P-ERC
      WHEN ANY
        CALLNAT 'XXGMSG-N' #XX-GMSG-PARMS
        P-ERROR-TEXT := #XX-SHORT-TEXT
      WHEN NONE
        P-ERROR-CODE := 5
        P-ERROR-TEXT := P-ERT
    END-DECIDE
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
  END-IF
  CALLNAT 'NAT00031' #TEN-SECONDS /* wait 10 seconds
  UNTIL PO-STATUS NE 'O'
END-REPEAT
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* WAIT-FOR-PRINTER
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE SET-PRINTING-STATUS
************************************************************************
RESET #RETRY
RETRY. REPEAT
  XXUX---P.P-FUNCTION := 'OPEN'
  CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
  COMPRESS '$EOM_WORK/nomchkpr.' *PID TO P-FILE-NAME LEAVING NO
  READLOG. REPEAT
    RESET #MSG
    XXUX---P.P-FUNCTION := 'READ'
    CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
    #RECORD := XXUX---P.P-RECORD
    EXAMINE #RECORD AND TRANSLATE INTO LOWER
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
    WRITE (AL=40)  *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Got output' XXUX---P.P-RECORD
    END-IF
    DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
      WHEN #RECORD = SCAN('error') OR = SCAN('fehler')
        #STATUS        := 'E' /* printer failed
        #MSG           := XXUX---P.P-RECORD
        P-ERROR-CODE   := 5
        P-ERROR-TEXT   := #MSG
      WHEN #RECORD = SCAN('working') OR = SCAN('arbeitet')
      #STATUS        := 'O' /* printer printing or intervention required
        #MSG           := XXUX---P.P-RECORD
      WHEN #RECORD = SCAN('finished') OR = SCAN('beendet')
        #STATUS        := 'D' /* printed successfully
        #XX-ERROR-CODE := 8815
      WHEN #RECORD = SCAN('unknown') OR = SCAN('unbekannt')
        #STATUS        := 'U' /* printer status unknown
        #XX-ERROR-CODE := 8858
      WHEN P-ERC NE 0 OR #EOF
        ADD 1 TO #RETRY
        IF #RETRY < #RETRIES
          RESET #EOF
          IF P-FILE-HANDLE NE 0
            XXUX---P.P-FUNCTION := 'CLOSE'
            CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
          END-IF
          CALLNAT 'NAT00031' #RETRY-INTERVAL
          ESCAPE BOTTOM (READLOG.)
        ELSE
          #STATUS        := 'U' /* printer status unknown
          #XX-ERROR-CODE := 8858
        END-IF
      WHEN ANY
        DECIDE ON EVERY VALUE OF #STATUS
          VALUES 'D','U'
            CALLNAT 'XXGMSG-N' #XX-GMSG-PARMS
            #MSG := #XX-SHORT-TEXT
          VALUE 'U'
            P-ERROR-CODE := #XX-ERROR-CODE
            P-ERROR-TEXT := #XX-SHORT-TEXT
          NONE
            IGNORE
        END-DECIDE
        IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
          WRITE (AL=40)  *PROGRAM
            *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
            'Updating status to' #STATUS / 32T 'message:' #MSG /
            32T 'Errors: ' P-ERROR-CODE P-ERROR-TEXT
        END-IF
        PERFORM UPDATE-STATUS
        IF P-FILE-HANDLE NE 0
          XXUX---P.P-FUNCTION := 'CLOSE'
          CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
        END-IF
        ESCAPE BOTTOM (RETRY.)
      WHEN NONE
        IGNORE
    END-DECIDE
  END-REPEAT
END-REPEAT
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* SET-PRINTING-STATUS
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE ASA-TO-NO-CC
************************************************************************
DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF LINE-L(I,1)
  VALUE '1'                 /* ASA form feed
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
      WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM
        *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Executing ASCII formfeed'
    END-IF
    LINE-L(I,1) := H'0C'
  VALUE '-'                 /* 3 line feeds
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Executing 3 ASCII linefeeds'
    END-IF
    WRITE (11) NOTITLE NOHDR / / /
    LINE (I) := SUBSTR(LINE(I),2)
    RESET +TOP-OF-PAGE
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Top of page reset'
    END-IF
  VALUE '0'                 /* 2 line feeds
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Executing 2 ASCII linefeeds'
    END-IF
    WRITE (11) NOTITLE NOHDR / /
    LINE (I) := SUBSTR(LINE(I),2)
    RESET +TOP-OF-PAGE
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Top of page reset'
    END-IF
  VALUE 'X'                 /* internal: formfeed after printed line
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'ASCII formfeed inserted after line:' LINE(I) (AL=40)
    END-IF
    LINE (I) := SUBSTR(LINE(I),2)
    COMPRESS LINE(I) H'0C' TO LINE(I) LEAVING NO
    +TOP-OF-PAGE := TRUE
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Top of page'
    END-IF
  VALUE 'Y'                 /* internal: formfeed before+after line
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'ASCII formfeed inserted after line:' LINE(I) (AL=40)
    END-IF
    MOVE H'0C' TO SUBSTR(LINE(I),1,1)
    COMPRESS LINE(I) H'0C' TO LINE(I) LEAVING NO
    +TOP-OF-PAGE := TRUE
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Top of page'
    END-IF
  NONE
    LINE (I) := SUBSTR(LINE(I),2)
    RESET +TOP-OF-PAGE      /* NOMALL-1148 was IGNORE
    IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '2'
     WRITE (AL=22) *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
        'Top of page reset'
    END-IF
END-DECIDE
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* ASA-TO-NO-CC
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE MACHINE-TO-ASA
************************************************************************
RMMCASA-PARMS.P-RECORD := LINE (I)
RMMCASA-PARMS.P-PREV-CC := FLUSH-SAVE-CC
CALLNAT 'RMMCASAN' RMMCASA-PARMS
FLUSH-SAVE-CC := RMMCASA-PARMS.P-PREV-CC
IF RMMCASA-PARMS.P-PRINT-NUMBER > 0
  LINE (I) := RMMCASA-PARMS.P-RECORD
ELSE
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* MACHINE-TO-ASA
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE NO-CC-TO-ASA
************************************************************************
COMPRESS '&' LINE(I) TO LINE(I) LEAVING NO
EXAMINE LINE(I) FOR '&' AND REPLACE FIRST WITH ' '
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* NO-CC-TO-ASA
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE BASE64-TO-BIN
************************************************************************
B64-FUNCTION := 'AB'                  /* convert base64 to bin
RESET B64-BRACKET B64-B
RESIZE ARRAY B64-TEXT-ARRAY TO (1:1)
B64-TEXT-ARRAY (1) := LINE (I)
CALLNAT 'RMBAS64N' B64-PARMS
P-ERROR-CODE := B64-RC
P-ERROR-TEXT := B64-ERRTXT
IF P-ERROR-CODE = 0
  LINE (I) := B64-B
  #BYTES := *LENGTH(B64-B)
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE GET-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES
************************************************************************
IF FLUSH-POID = 0
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
FNDPO. FIND ORDER-STATUS WITH PO-ID = FLUSH-POID
  #REPNAME := PO-REPNAME
  #REPRNB  := PO-REPRNB
  FIND ACTIVE-REPORTS WITH AR-REPORT-RNB = #REPORT-RNB
    #SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES := AR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES
    RESET #FILE-ID
    DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF #SPOOL-TYPE
      VALUE DIRECT-INPUT
        IF #SPOOL-DI-FILENAME NE ' '
          XXHASH-PARMS.P-SHORT-NAME := #SPOOL-DI-FILENAME
          PERFORM GET-LONG-NAME
        END-IF
        IF #SPOOL-DI-FILETYPE NE ' '
         COMPRESS #FILE-ID '.' #SPOOL-DI-FILETYPE TO #FILE-ID LEAVING NO
        END-IF
        PERFORM BUILD-NAME
      VALUE SEQUENTIAL-FILE-UNIX
        XXHASH-PARMS.P-SHORT-NAME := #SPOOL-UNIX-FILE-NAME
        PERFORM GET-LONG-NAME
        PERFORM BUILD-NAME
      NONE IGNORE
    END-DECIDE
  END-FIND
END-FIND
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* GET-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE BUILD-NAME
************************************************************************
IF PHYSICAL-NAME = ' '               /* write to $EOM_WORK
  COMPRESS '$EOM_WORK/' #FILE-ID TO PHYSICAL-NAME LEAVING NO
ELSE
  #PHYSICAL-NAME := PHYSICAL-NAME /* NOMALL-823 in
  PERFORM RMFL---S-SUBSTITUTE-SYMBOLS FLUSH-PARMS PHYSICAL-NAME
    #SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES /* NOMALL-856 2011-03-04 in
  IF NATUNIX-TRACE = '1' OR = '2' AND PHYSICAL-NAME NE #PHYSICAL-NAME
    WRITE *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
      'Replaced:' / 32T #PHYSICAL-NAME / 32T PHYSICAL-NAME
  END-IF
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* BUILD-NAME
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE GET-LONG-NAME
************************************************************************
XXHASH-PARMS.P-FUNCTION   := 'L' /*short -> long
PERFORM XXHASH XXHASH-PARMS
#FILE-ID := XXHASH-PARMS.P-LONG-NAME
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* GET-LONG-NAME
*
************************************************************************
ON ERROR
************************************************************************
  BACKOUT TRANSACTION
  FUNCTION := 'G'
  CALLNAT 'NAT00080' NAT00080L NAT00080N.EXTENDED-PARMS
  PRINT *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II':'SS'.'T)
    'Current printer parameters:' / '='  PAGE-SIZE '='  LINE-SIZE
    '='  MAX-PAGES / '='  PRINT-METHOD '='  OUTPUT-TARGET /
    '='  PHYSICAL-NAME //
  FLUSH-ERROR := TRUE
  P-ERROR-CODE := 21
  CALLNAT 'C-NATERN' P-ERROR-TEXT
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
*
END-ERROR
*
INCLUDE RMPR-C /*V12-PRINTER-API,CALL-PRINTER-EXIT
*
END
